713
00:41:13,930 --> 00:41:18,050
You can do this similarly with Qualtrics or any other kind of form-based software.

714
00:41:18,050 --> 00:41:20,930
You can ask RockBot to basically create it for you.

715
00:41:20,930 --> 00:41:23,610
So what we're going to do is I'm just going to say, and I'm going to use

716
00:41:23,610 --> 00:41:28,130
