725
00:41:56,890 --> 00:41:59,530
GrokVoys can actually talk back to you.

726
00:41:59,530 --> 00:42:03,130
That should be out, hopefully, sometime within the next week or so.

727
00:42:03,130 --> 00:42:06,970
But this is kind of a good way to see that speech-to-text in motion here.

728
00:42:06,970 --> 00:42:10,130
So you'll see that it kind of took everything I said.

729
00:42:10,130 --> 00:42:12,810
I'm actually going to move to the side here so you all can see.

730
00:42:12,810 --> 00:42:15,490
And then immediately, when you send a request like this,

731
00:42:15,490 --> 00:42:19,450
GrokVoy is going to respond and immediately start working.

732
00:42:19,450 --> 00:42:23,010
And when it works, for example, in something like a Google Form,

