00:42:31,290 --> 00:42:34,090
I can actually click into it and see what it's doing.

737
00:42:34,090 --> 00:42:35,970
Give it a little moment to connect.

738
00:42:35,970 --> 00:42:38,410
But once it's connected, you'll see that it has access

739
00:42:38,410 --> 00:42:40,170
to its own Linux VM machine.

740
00:42:40,170 --> 00:42:44,050
So it'll be able to log into Google Slides, Google Forms, Google Docs,

741
00:42:44,050 --> 00:42:45,850
whatever you need.

742
00:42:45,850 --> 00:42:50,010
And so what you can see, actually, if I minimize this,

743
00:42:50,010 --> 00:42:53,530
is it's going to build both of those questions for me.

744
00:42:53,530 --> 00:42:57,420
And I can monitor how it's building those in those forms.

