753
00:43:18,460 --> 00:43:20,980
And so this is kind of a good way to see what existing

754
00:43:20,980 --> 00:43:22,820
APIs and MCPs are there already.

755
00:43:22,820 --> 00:43:26,180
Or you can ask GrokBot to set it up for you.

