00:43:49,060 --> 00:43:51,620
And this kind of makes it a lot easier for enterprises

766
00:43:51,620 --> 00:43:55,760
to control what the bot can or cannot do in a big setting

767
00:43:55,760 --> 00:43:57,560
like this.

