I can go to Insert, and I can add animation here.

789
00:44:49,920 --> 00:44:52,720
And notice that this is me controlling the bot's computer.

790
00:44:52,720 --> 00:44:54,720
So this is not the bot doing this on its own.

791
00:44:54,720 --> 00:44:56,880
This is me kind of controlling it.

792
00:44:56,880 --> 00:45:00,360
And I can say, OK, this is how you would do a kind of,

