00:45:15,240 --> 00:45:20,680
It looks like it's monitoring the time that the animation takes.

799
00:45:20,680 --> 00:45:21,400
Amazing.

800
00:45:21,400 --> 00:45:25,080
So now that it's set up here and it knows exactly how to do it,

