00:45:56,450 --> 00:45:58,930
What's nice about having these agents

815
00:45:58,930 --> 00:46:01,090
is that I can always go back and forth between them

816
00:46:01,090 --> 00:46:03,930
and also see how they operate within each other.

817
00:46:03,930 --> 00:46:06,090
So as you can see, side Sonya is learning

